<title>JAPAN: Japan May nickel imports jump 25.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan May nickel imports jump 25.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined nickel imports totalled 6,367 tonnes in May, up 25.3 percent from 5,081 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Details were as follows (on a customs-cleared basis, in tonnes):</p>
<p>		 May 97	  April 97	     May 96</p>
<p> Total	6,367	     6,776		 5,081</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia     1,030	     1,570		   915</p>
<p> Zimbabwe   1,022		 884		   601</p>
<p> Australia    598		 354		   402</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first five months of 1997 totalled 27,639 tonnes, up from 25,593 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
